Third-party components

Grammaid bundles or downloads the following, each under its own license:

- Harper (harper.js), Apache-2.0, https://github.com/Automattic/harper
- Transformers.js (@huggingface/transformers), Apache-2.0
- ONNX Runtime Web, MIT
- compromise, MIT
- Preact, MIT
- WordNet 3.1, Princeton University, WordNet License
  (https://wordnet.princeton.edu/license-and-commercial-use).
  src/data/wordnet-synonyms.json is derived from WordNet.
- Models downloaded at runtime from Hugging Face: Xenova/distilgpt2 and
  Xenova/flan-t5-small (both Apache-2.0).
